"PhysX vs Newton/MuJoCo layers kept separate. Connect ROS 2 with one path:"
" host `hardware:=isaac` (`TopicBasedSystem`) **or** a `ROS2ControlLaunch`"
" payload that sets in-process `isaac_sim`. Do not bridge the same joints "
"on both."
