"`robots/mobile_manipulator/…`). FaSim-Isaac checkout: **`./init.sh`** "
"(submodules + optional Isaac ROS 2 workspace), then **`./run.sh`**. See "
"[Isaac Sim](../2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)."
msgstr ""
"资产布局：[robot_usds README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README.md)（`robots/manipulators/…`、`robots/mobile_manipulator"
"/…`）。FaSim-Isaac 检出后：**`./init.sh`**（子模块 + 可选 Isaac ROS 2 工作区），然后 "
"**`./run.sh`**。不要手写 Isaac `PATH` 或 `~/.bashrc` overlay。见 [Isaac "
"Sim](../2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)。"

